# Axiara price list template — official baseline (data/main/)
# Copy this file to price-list.csv and fill it in with Excel / WPS / Numbers.
# Then hand it to the Agent: "import price-list.csv into data/main/"
# Rules:
#   - lines starting with # are comments, ignored on import
#   - keep the header row exactly as-is (column names are recognized)
#   - unit_price must be a number; currency uses ISO codes (CNY / USD / EUR / JPY ...)
name,spec,unit,unit_price,currency,effective_date,note
